///                                    ###
///                                    * When the difference between |PCRn-STCn| and |PCRn-1-STCn-1| is smaller than MaxDiff, it will be taken as normal fluctuation. If the difference is bigger than MaxDiff, it’ll be taken as a PCR jump. Config by ARM. Default value is 9000 (100ms).
///                                    ###
///     @ 0x00008                      (P)
///               %unsigned 32 LockedDiff                0x0
///                                    ###
///                                    * The PCR/STC value difference when a steady time base is established.
///                                    ###
///     @ 0x0000C                      (P)
///               %unsigned 32 CurDiff                   0x0
///                                    ###
///                                    * The PCR and STC difference of the latest PCR/STC pair.
///                                    ###
///     @ 0x00010                      (P)
///               %unsigned 32 LastDiff                  0x0
///                                    ###
///                                    * The PCR and STC difference of the last PCR/STC pair.
